Canonical website:
  https://github.com/indexdata/yazpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/indexdata/yazpp/archive/refs/tags/v1.8.1.tar.gz#/yazpp-1.8.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack yazpp-1.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./yazpp-1.8.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/yazpp-1.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/yazpp-1.8.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libyazpp6-1.8.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libyazpp-devel-1.8.1-X.tar.xz

